# Code owners for loxitui.
# Owners are requested for review automatically on matching PRs. Branch
# protection (scripts/apply-governance.sh) sets require_code_owner_reviews, so
# a code owner's approval is REQUIRED to merge, and the `release` Environment
# requires an owner's approval before anything is published.
# GitHub reads .github/CODEOWNERS with precedence over a root CODEOWNERS —
# this is the single authoritative file. Order matters: the LAST matching
# pattern for a path wins. Every listed owner must have write access.
# Owners mirror MAINTAINERS.md (maintainer council) plus the loxilb-devel
# review account. The attlab.org maintainers are listed by e-mail: GitHub
# accepts an e-mail only if it is verified on an account with write access —
# replace with @handles once known.

